 "slot_change_request": "H-D4G5/HOSTEP 10-18 -> H-D4G (GEN2): the host_cp slot now holds host_ep (hfd_ep_static 434.72 x 315.36, W face sd_* to host_N, S face = COLL face) and directly south of it host_cp_rxs (434.72 x 432, N face mirrors the ep S face pin for pin, S face AXI to host_cp_ingress + faults + session straps). host_phy / host_cp_ep / host_cp_ep_face / host_cp_rx slots retire.",
